  kind: 1
  title: "Ki\u1EC3m tra nhanh \u2014 ng\xE0y 4"
  intro: "B\xE0i tr\xEAn l\u1EDBp: c\xE2u h\u1ECFi nhi\u1EC5u nhi\u1EC1u h\u01A1n.
    Ch\u1ECDn \u0111\xE1p \xE1n ch\u1EB7t ch\u1EBD nh\u1EA5t (ki\u1EC3u event h\xE0i
    h\u01B0\u1EDBc)."
  questions:
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 4] Trong UI/UX, 'affordance' g\u1EA7n ngh\u0129a
      l\xE0 g\xEC?"
    options:
    - "G\u1EE3i \xFD c\xE1ch d\xF9ng qua h\xECnh d\u1EA1ng/nh\xE3n"
    - "S\u1ED1 l\u01B0\u1EE3ng m\xE0u t\u1ED1i \u0111a"
    - FPS
    - "\u0110\u1ED9 ph\xE2n gi\u1EA3i texture"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 4] 'Accessibility' (a11y) trong game/app th\u01B0\u1EDDng
      nh\u1EAFm t\u1EDBi:"
    options:
    - "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi d\xF9ng c\xF3 nhu c\u1EA7u kh\xE1c nhau (th\u1ECB gi\xE1c/th\xEDnh
      gi\xE1c/\u0111i\u1EC1u khi\u1EC3n\u2026)"
    - "Ch\u1EC9 dark mode"
    - "Ch\u1EC9 font size"
    - "Ch\u1EC9 marketing"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 4] M\u1ED9t 'deadlock' (OS) x\u1EA3y ra khi
      n\xE0o (\xFD t\u01B0\u1EDFng)?"
    options:
    - "C\xE1c ti\u1EBFn tr\xECnh ch\u1EDD l\u1EABn nhau theo v\xF2ng k\xEDn t\xE0i
      nguy\xEAn"
    - "CPU qu\xE1 nhanh"
    - RAM = 0
    - "Ch\u1EC9 x\u1EA3y ra tr\xEAn Linux"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 4] Trong Unity, 'FixedUpdate' th\u01B0\u1EDDng
      ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p cho:"
    options:
    - "V\u1EADt l\xFD b\u01B0\u1EDBc c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh (\xFD t\u01B0\u1EDFng)"
    - "V\u1EBD UI layout m\u1ED7i frame"
    - "Load scene b\u1EA5t \u0111\u1ED3ng b\u1ED9"
    - "G\u1ECDi API HTTP"
    correctIndex: 0
    explanation: 
  - prompt: "[L\u1EDBp \u2014 ng\xE0y 4] Ch\u1ECDn c\xE2u \u0111\xFAng v\u1EC1 'serialization'
      (l\u01B0u tr\u1EEF tr\u1EA1ng th\xE1i):"
    options:
    - "Chuy\u1EC3n object th\xE0nh d\u1EA1ng c\xF3 th\u1EC3 l\u01B0u/chuy\u1EC3n
      r\u1ED3i kh\xF4i ph\u1EE5c (\xFD t\u01B0\u1EDFng)"
    - "Lu\xF4n an to\xE0n m\xE0 kh\xF4ng c\u1EA7n versioning"
    - "Kh\xF4ng bao gi\u1EDD l\u1ED7i schema"
    - "Ch\u1EC9 JSON"
